  "question": {
    "text": "The positive value of the determinant of the matrix&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>, whose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>, is ______.",
